      "dedupe_key": "mini-morris-feathered-friends|2026-10-15|william-morris",
      "description": "Join us for Mini Morris drop in sessions. Toddler-friendly crafting for 2-5 year olds. In October we’re celebrating the much-anticipated reopening of the Gallery following its refurbishment. Inspired by the beautiful birds that appear throughout William Morris’s designs, children will create their very own clay pot bird to take home. Children will explore shape and texture as they decorate their bird, taking inspiration from the nature and wildlife that Morris loved so much. It’s a wonderful opportunity to get creative, discover the newly reopened Gallery and enjoy some hands-on fun together. Mini Morris sessions are now DROP IN ONLY. FREE. Donations welcome. As this can be a messy session, please wear or bring old clothes. Aprons are available. All sessions include the craft activity, singing and a snack to take away. Led by artist educator Lesley Palmer of Scribble & Smudge. Image: Strawberry Thief printed cotton, William Morris. Design registered 1883",
